Sec.A38.0725.AALIST OF PRIORITY FACILITIES. (a)AAIn this
section, "priority facility" means:
(1)AAa facility listed in Section 38.072(b); or
(2)AAa facility for which electric service is
considered crucial for the protection or maintenance of public
safety, including:
(A)AAa hospital;
(B)AAa police station;
(C)AAa fire station;
(D)AAa critical water or wastewater facility; and
(E)AAa confinement facility operated by or under a
contract with any division of the Texas Department of Criminal
Justice.
(b)AAAn electric utility shall maintain a list of priority
facilities in the utility ’s retail service area that includes the
